{"unit_id":"LINGTIAN303__dsh-model-tabs#feature-1","repo":"LINGTIAN303/dsh-model-tabs","commit":"96ef1860e75b60eaa5bc929ad974bb668837efad","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-tabs 的功能「提供商与模型系列筛选」：在对话输入区打开模型列表后，大目录会显示两级 Tab，先选择提供商再选择模型系列，并可叠加搜索缩小结果；用户可在设置页调整触发阈值。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/ModelTabs.js:4-10","src/client/SettingsPanel.js:4-9"]}
